&lt;p style="margin-left: 30px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;　該当事項はありません。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 36px; text-align: left; text-indent: -36px"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
</jpcrp_cor:CriticalContractsForOperationTextBlock>
